      "session_id": "scenario:it_ticket_pilot:v2",
      "kind": "material",
      "object_id": "tech_private",
      "version": 1,
      "config_version": null,
      "span_start": 120,
      "span_end": 521,
      "quote": "Diagnostic input: I've already signed up for company training. Does that mean I can simply turn up to attend the class? At the default threshold 0.35 there was no supported passage; at the comparison threshold 0.2 the answer returned the training-registration passage, and the same unrelated control question still had no hit. This covers only this input and is not a universally calibrated threshold.",
      "observed_at_seq": 0,
      "valid_from_seq": 0,
      "valid_until_seq": null
    },
    "disclosure": {
      "schema_version": 2,
      "mode": "paraphrase_only",
      "actors": [
        "tech_lead"
      ],
      "paraphrase": "A preparation-stage test reproduced this question: I've already signed up for company training. Does that mean I can simply turn up to attend the class? At thresholds 0.35 and the current default 0.3 it retrieved no supported passage. At 0.2 it returned Device repair, which does not answer the training question. Lowering the threshold did not solve this case. An unrelated control still retrieved nothing. This is an observed English diagnostic, not a recommended threshold."
    }
